### Get home
GET http://localhost:3001/

### Get all songs
GET http://localhost:3001/songs

### Get song by id
GET http://localhost:3001/songs/1

### Create song
POST http://localhost:3001/songs
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
    "title": "Uptown Funk",
    "artist": "Bruno Mars",
    "duration_seconds": 270,
    "release_date": "2014-11-10",
    "language": "English"
}

### Update song by id
PUT http://localhost:3001/songs/1

### Delete song by id
DELETE http://localhost:3001/songs/1

